 time I flew, the plane shook so bad that <b>cargo</b> started falling. My parents told me to listen to music and read a <b>chapter</b> in my book. It calmed me,\" Rachel said.</p>    <p style=\"margin-bottom: 1rem;\">Suddenly, the plane shook again. This time, Isaac followed Rachel's advice. He put on headphones and took out a book by his favorite <b>author</b>. The book and the music helped Isaac feel better. After a while, he didn't even notice the bad weather. The bad situation didn't feel so bad after someone helped him.</p></div>",
